{"events": [{"tStartMs": 560, "dDurationMs": 3359, "segs": [{"utf8": "我本想,呃,我已经准备了 几句话欢迎", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 3919, "dDurationMs": 3761, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们的贵宾,我当然想欢迎", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 7680, "dDurationMs": 3839, "segs": [{"utf8": "尊敬的唐纳德·特朗普,美国总统", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 11519, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "国家,陛下,阁下,阁下", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 15759, "dDurationMs": 4241, "segs": [{"utf8": "各位晚上好,在这个极其重要的夜晚", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 20000, "dDurationMs": 6880, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们刚刚举行了Azan 49的闭幕式", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 26880, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "这周很充实,很有价值", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 29920, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "马尼拉。 我们召集了朋友和伙伴", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 33200, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "环游世界 花了几天时间倾听", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 35920, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "并寻找新的合作方式。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 39920, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "正如我今天下午所说 我们的搭档们", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 43360, "dDurationMs": 5039, "segs": [{"utf8": "成为整个阿赞家族中非常重要的一部分", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 48399, "dDurationMs": 5361, "segs": [{"utf8": "很高兴在好人陪伴下结束这一年", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 53760, "dDurationMs": 5520, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们为纪念联合国", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 59280, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "川普总统来了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 61520, "dDurationMs": 4080, "segs": [{"utf8": "因此,川普总统,再次代表阿赞,这是我们的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 65600, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "非常高兴地欢迎你们来到马尼拉。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 69040, "dDurationMs": 3439, "segs": [{"utf8": "你的存在证实了我们已经知道 Azan和", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 72479, "dDurationMs": 3761, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国是塑造该区域", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 76240, "dDurationMs": 5680, "segs": [{"utf8": "未来。 我们菲律宾人非常了解这种友谊。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 81920, "dDurationMs": 3920, "segs": [{"utf8": "今年我们标志着80年的外交关系", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 85840, "dDurationMs": 4480, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们两国 我们的关系是建立在共享之上的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 90320, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "历史、共同价值观和继续", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 94640, "dDurationMs": 3119, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们的人民,包括数百万菲律宾人民", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 97759, "dDurationMs": 5761, "segs": [{"utf8": "每天都生活在其中的菲律宾裔美国人.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 103520, "dDurationMs": 4400, "segs": [{"utf8": "对Azan来说,这种伙伴关系甚至更深入,跨越了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 107920, "dDurationMs": 5199, "segs": [{"utf8": "贸易、投资、技术、安全和", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 113119, "dDurationMs": 2881, "segs": [{"utf8": "当然是菲律宾。 当我被问到: 什么是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 116000, "dDurationMs": 2880, "segs": [{"utf8": "你和美联社关系最重要的部分", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 118880, "dDurationMs": 5040, "segs": [{"utf8": "国家?\" 我不能回答这个问题,因为没有", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 123920, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们菲律宾生活的一部分 不涉及", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 128160, "dDurationMs": 4719, "segs": [{"utf8": "以某种形式或形式与美国", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 132879, "dDurationMs": 3921, "segs": [{"utf8": "另一个 这就是伙伴关系的深度", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 136800, "dDurationMs": 4960, "segs": [{"utf8": "这就是伙伴关系将继续深入的程度。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 141760, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "明年,阿赞和美国庆祝50年", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 146080, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "对话关系和五年全面对话", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 150080, "dDurationMs": 2080, "segs": [{"utf8": "战略伙伴关系。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 152160, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "在我完成之前,我只想做一个非常", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 155280, "dDurationMs": 4319, "segs": [{"utf8": "先生,为了迎接你的到来 简单宣布一下", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 159599, "dDurationMs": 7761, "segs": [{"utf8": "总统和我们知道你渴望结果", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 167360, "dDurationMs": 5120, "segs": [{"utf8": "呃,不是说说 我们的员工一直在工作", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 172480, "dDurationMs": 4479, "segs": [{"utf8": "亚桑和呃 你们的员工一直合作", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 176959, "dDurationMs": 5121, "segs": [{"utf8": "而我们来到了呃... ... ......", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 182080, "dDurationMs": 5360, "segs": [{"utf8": "通过了打击网上骗局的原则,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 187440, "dDurationMs": 5760, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们还通过了10项公开声明。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 193200, "dDurationMs": 3679, "segs": [{"utf8": "关于处理网上欺诈的私营伙伴关系原则", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 196879, "dDurationMs": 2161, "segs": [{"utf8": "和综合工作计划。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 199040, "dDurationMs": 4400, "segs": [{"utf8": "因此,这是这次特别首脑会议的直接结果", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 203440, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "在阿赞和美国之间", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 206800, "dDurationMs": 2799, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们期待着庆祝所有里程碑", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 209599, "dDurationMs": 3841, "segs": [{"utf8": "阿赞与美国和菲律宾之间", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 213440, "dDurationMs": 4079, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国。 我们期待着继续", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 217519, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "你是我们的朋友和搭档", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 220959, "dDurationMs": 6521, "segs": [{"utf8": "再次感谢和欢迎特朗普总统来到马尼拉.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 244239, "dDurationMs": 3920, "segs": [{"utf8": "非常感谢 很荣幸能来到这里", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 248159, "dDurationMs": 2481, "segs": [{"utf8": "很多我认识很久的朋友", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 250640, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "突然间我一直在做这个 看起来像一个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 253840, "dDurationMs": 4959, "segs": [{"utf8": "很久了,不过我认识你们大多数人,你们也认识", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 258799, "dDurationMs": 4161, "segs": [{"utf8": "管理你们的国家和水平", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 262960, "dDurationMs": 4080, "segs": [{"utf8": "受欢迎,这不容易, 但你做了一个伟大的工作。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 267040, "dDurationMs": 2879, "segs": [{"utf8": "因此,与您同在是一种荣誉. 我想谢谢你", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 269919, "dDurationMs": 6241, "segs": [{"utf8": "马库斯总统对马尼拉和", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 276160, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "东盟峰会.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 278080, "dDurationMs": 3679, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在全世界都变得很重要了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 281759, "dDurationMs": 2641, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们在谈论你的祖国 你知道这一点。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 284400, "dDurationMs": 4480, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们谈论着东盟和他出色的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 288880, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "担任东盟主席的领导。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 290800, "dDurationMs": 3839, "segs": [{"utf8": "今年是创纪录的一年。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 294639, "dDurationMs": 2481, "segs": [{"utf8": "回到菲律宾真是令人高兴", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 297120, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "我去过很多次了 我只是不想", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 301680, "dDurationMs": 4239, "segs": [{"utf8": "约会我自己 但我很了解你父母", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 305919, "dDurationMs": 3761, "segs": [{"utf8": "很不错。 我相信遗传学 他们做得很好", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 309680, "dDurationMs": 2959, "segs": [{"utf8": "你有非常好的遗传学 我可以告诉你。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 312639, "dDurationMs": 4321, "segs": [{"utf8": "但美国最古老和最重要的盟友之一", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 316960, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们的国家和世界的坦诚。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 320160, "dDurationMs": 4960, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国是一个真正意义上的太平洋国家", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 325120, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们一直从事贸易、商业和外交", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 329440, "dDurationMs": 4479, "segs": [{"utf8": "横跨东南亚数百年", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 333919, "dDurationMs": 2961, "segs": [{"utf8": "我今天来这里是因为美国对", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 336880, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们许多朋友的成功、主权和繁荣", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 339680, "dDurationMs": 5120, "segs": [{"utf8": "和合作伙伴,他们中的许多人现在在这个议席上。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 344800, "dDurationMs": 3119, "segs": [{"utf8": "但是,这个地区的伙伴,我们永远是。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 347919, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们永远和你在一起。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 349919, "dDurationMs": 5840, "segs": [{"utf8": "如你所知 去年在马来西亚举行的东盟会议上", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 355759, "dDurationMs": 3201, "segs": [{"utf8": "阿努尔总理和我促成历史性和平", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 358960, "dDurationMs": 4079, "segs": [{"utf8": "柬埔寨和泰国之间的协定", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 363039, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "伦珀和平协定。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 365759, "dDurationMs": 3681, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们实现了停火 拯救了上千人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 369440, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "成千上万人的生命,也许不止这些。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 372800, "dDurationMs": 4480, "segs": [{"utf8": "因此,无数流离失所的平民", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 377280, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "能够返回他们的家园。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 379120, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "我从柬埔寨得到了一个巨大的感谢。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 382960, "dDurationMs": 4079, "segs": [{"utf8": "我得到了大家的感谢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 387039, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "这张桌子 这是一件伟大的事情。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 389199, "dDurationMs": 2241, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们一起做的好事", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 391440, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们仍然致力于维持停火和", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 394400, "dDurationMs": 4239, "segs": [{"utf8": "确保完全忠实地执行该协定。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 398639, "dDurationMs": 3601, "segs": [{"utf8": "一年前就同意了 一年前就同意了 我认为它会坚持下去。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 402240, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "相处得很好", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 403840, "dDurationMs": 4079, "segs": [{"utf8": "据我所知,在过去两年里,我们也", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 407919, "dDurationMs": 3201, "segs": [{"utf8": "今晚与许多国家密切合作", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 411120, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "加强和深化与你的经济关系.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 414800, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国正在建立记录。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 417600, "dDurationMs": 3520, "segs": [{"utf8": "22.2万亿美元在美国投资", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 421120, "dDurationMs": 5519, "segs": [{"utf8": "自从我就职不到两年前", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 426639, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "想想那22.2万亿", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 429759, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "这比任何国家都多得多", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 433759, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "东南亚是最繁忙的商业十字路口之一", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 437039, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "在地球上。 世界航运流量的四分之一", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 440319, "dDurationMs": 3521, "segs": [{"utf8": "穿过马拉的直道", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 443840, "dDurationMs": 3520, "segs": [{"utf8": "自从我回到办公室后 我们做了大买卖", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 447360, "dDurationMs": 5200, "segs": [{"utf8": "与马来西亚、柬埔寨、印度尼西亚和日本的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 452560, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "韩国,以及几乎所有的人,坦率地说,都坐在桌子上。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 456160, "dDurationMs": 4960, "segs": [{"utf8": "刚才我和首相签了个新协议", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 461120, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "泰国的艾伦·牛顿.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 463280, "dDurationMs": 2479, "segs": [{"utf8": "首相先生,你能站起来吗?", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 465759, "dDurationMs": 2241, "segs": [{"utf8": "不错", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 468000, "dDurationMs": 2479, "segs": [{"utf8": "他做的比我好很多,但这些都不算什么", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 470479, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "细节。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 472319, "dDurationMs": 1600, "segs": [{"utf8": "非常感谢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 473919, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们达成了许多其他重要协议", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 476879, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "包括能源、关键矿物和技术。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 480879, "dDurationMs": 2801, "segs": [{"utf8": "我希望你会很努力地工作", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 483680, "dDurationMs": 2959, "segs": [{"utf8": "关键矿物、稀土和磁铁。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 486639, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "如果你不介意的话 去拿磁铁来", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 488639, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "有人在桌边会说,\"我要听", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 490479, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "给他,你会赚很多钱。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 492639, "dDurationMs": 2161, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们要磁铁。”", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 494800, "dDurationMs": 3679, "segs": [{"utf8": "感谢韩国的历史性投资.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 498479, "dDurationMs": 3921, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们刚刚批准了巨大的液态天然气", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 502400, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "便利出口记录的阿拉斯加管道", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 506240, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国向合作伙伴提供的大量负担得起的能源", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 510560, "dDurationMs": 1919, "segs": [{"utf8": "整个太平洋", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 512479, "dDurationMs": 3281, "segs": [{"utf8": "如你所知 我一直很强壮,现在我们", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 515760, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "是俄罗斯和沙特阿拉伯的两倍", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 520320, "dDurationMs": 1839, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们在一起远不止于此。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 522159, "dDurationMs": 4321, "segs": [{"utf8": "因此,在能量方面,我们只是第一。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 526480, "dDurationMs": 4240, "segs": [{"utf8": "这个历史性的基础设施项目将是非常了不起的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 530720, "dDurationMs": 2799, "segs": [{"utf8": "特别的。 这将降低能源成本,增加能源", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 533519, "dDurationMs": 2561, "segs": [{"utf8": "区域各国和所有国家的安全", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 536080, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "这个世界 美国也在领导世界", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 539680, "dDurationMs": 4960, "segs": [{"utf8": "超级情报SI和我们拥有最强大的世界", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 544640, "dDurationMs": 4639, "segs": [{"utf8": "SI生态系统. 我们带领大家 有很多,我们希望", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 549279, "dDurationMs": 2961, "segs": [{"utf8": "保持它的方式 我们将保持它的方式。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 552240, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们很高兴能和每一个国家合作", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 555360, "dDurationMs": 4479, "segs": [{"utf8": "今天在这里,谁想为科技和", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 559839, "dDurationMs": 5120, "segs": [{"utf8": "释放它带来的巨大的经济增长。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 564959, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们说,呃作为一个例子,超级智能是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 569519, "dDurationMs": 2241, "segs": [{"utf8": "将会比工业革命更伟大", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 571760, "dDurationMs": 3440, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们等着瞧 但到目前为止,它似乎 看起来像如此远", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 575200, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "比互联网大,比工业大", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 578320, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "革命。 革命。 因此,巨大的经济增长创造了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 581440, "dDurationMs": 4560, "segs": [{"utf8": "工作,解开科学和医学的奥秘", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 586000, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "保护我们的人民、我们的安全和我们的价值观。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 589040, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们必须像其他一切一样小心", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 592080, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "却作么生会. 我们看过一些医学治疗", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 595760, "dDurationMs": 4720, "segs": [{"utf8": "医疗解决方案已运作了50年", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 600480, "dDurationMs": 1919, "segs": [{"utf8": "几分钟后就结束了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 602399, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是相当惊人的。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 605519, "dDurationMs": 3601, "segs": [{"utf8": "从能源到技术到安全 远远超出", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 609120, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "世上没有比美国更好的搭档了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 612720, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国 两年前 我们的国家不是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 616320, "dDurationMs": 2639, "segs": [{"utf8": "干得不错。 坦率地说,我们是一个已死的国家。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 618959, "dDurationMs": 2081, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在,我们是世界上最热的国家", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 621040, "dDurationMs": 2640, "segs": [{"utf8": "你们今晚都这么说了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 623680, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "没有动摇你,先生。 你干得不错", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 625440, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "你的国家很热.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 627120, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "但我会告诉你,在过去的政府,我们", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 629920, "dDurationMs": 2400, "segs": [{"utf8": "一个死去的国家。 如果他们死了,我们就死定了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 632320, "dDurationMs": 5040, "segs": [{"utf8": "赢了 在我们的领导下,美国的出口正在", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 637360, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "有史以来最高的。 我们从来没有,你知道,呃,这是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 641200, "dDurationMs": 2240, "segs": [{"utf8": "相当惊人,因为人们认为我们不是一个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 643440, "dDurationMs": 3200, "segs": [{"utf8": "制造业国家。 然而,我们只是设置", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 646640, "dDurationMs": 4480, "segs": [{"utf8": "创下了出口创历史新高的纪录。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 651120, "dDurationMs": 1839, "segs": [{"utf8": "这意味着制造。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 652959, "dDurationMs": 2961, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国能源产量创历史新高.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 655920, "dDurationMs": 4000, "segs": [{"utf8": "个人收入最高。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 659920, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "今天在美国工作的人比以前多", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 662720, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "从前 我们有创纪录的人数在工作", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 665440, "dDurationMs": 4160, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国。 大部分是因为我们的经济", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 669600, "dDurationMs": 4479, "segs": [{"utf8": "政策。 因此,由于我们前所未有的投资", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 674079, "dDurationMs": 3041, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国武装部队,美国也有最强大的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 677120, "dDurationMs": 4320, "segs": [{"utf8": "和地球上最有能力的军事。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 681440, "dDurationMs": 3839, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们重视强大的国防伙伴关系。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 685279, "dDurationMs": 3041, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以我们有你 还有我们的装备", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 688320, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们制造最好的设备。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 690240, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "你在委内瑞拉看到的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 692160, "dDurationMs": 2239, "segs": [{"utf8": "你在伊朗看见了 你到处都能看到", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 694399, "dDurationMs": 2481, "segs": [{"utf8": "每个人都在买它。 这是任何地方最好的设备", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 696880, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "这个世界 其实我们是 呃 因为你也要等", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 699920, "dDurationMs": 3599, "segs": [{"utf8": "长。 所以,我们正在做的是,呃, 国防公司是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 703519, "dDurationMs": 3121, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在建造了超过22个工厂 制造爱国者", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 706640, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "系统,托马霍克,以及其他一切。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 710240, "dDurationMs": 2159, "segs": [{"utf8": "因此,这是相当惊人的 发生的事情。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 712399, "dDurationMs": 2721, "segs": [{"utf8": "但我们有世界上最好的设备", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 715120, "dDurationMs": 3279, "segs": [{"utf8": "今年早些时候,我们宣布了一项重大国防合作", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 718399, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "与印度尼西亚合作扩大我们的合作关系。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 722079, "dDurationMs": 1760, "segs": [{"utf8": "你会在哪里印度尼西亚?", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 723839, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "我看到我的朋友在这里某处。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 725519, "dDurationMs": 1601, "segs": [{"utf8": "请站起来好吗?", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 727120, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "他真是个害羞的人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 729600, "dDurationMs": 2239, "segs": [{"utf8": "他干得不错 非常感谢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 731839, "dDurationMs": 2721, "segs": [{"utf8": "祝贺你,也。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 734560, "dDurationMs": 3519, "segs": [{"utf8": "伟大的领袖 扩大我们的联合特种部队训练", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 738079, "dDurationMs": 3760, "segs": [{"utf8": "并共同致力于国防现代化建设.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 741839, "dDurationMs": 4081, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们还大大加强了我们的国防合作", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 745920, "dDurationMs": 4080, "segs": [{"utf8": "历史上是美国的关键", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 750000, "dDurationMs": 2959, "segs": [{"utf8": "爱丽。 但我不认为我们曾经 比我们更亲近", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 752959, "dDurationMs": 3201, "segs": [{"utf8": "现在,因为我们的个人关系。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 756160, "dDurationMs": 3280, "segs": [{"utf8": "我们百分之百支持我们的伙伴和盟友。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 759440, "dDurationMs": 2399, "segs": [{"utf8": "当有问题,你会打电话给我。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 761839, "dDurationMs": 1521, "segs": [{"utf8": "你会打电话给马可。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 763360, "dDurationMs": 1840, "segs": [{"utf8": "你会打电话给其他人。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 765200, "dDurationMs": 1920, "segs": [{"utf8": "如果他们不回应,给我打电话", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 767120, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "我接你的电话 我会说,\"马可,你被解雇了。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 770240, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "你反应不够快", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 772560, "dDurationMs": 3839, "segs": [{"utf8": "马可有多辣? 对 马可做得很好", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 776399, "dDurationMs": 3601, "segs": [{"utf8": "他一直很厉害 斯科特和霍华德,我们有一个伟大的", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 780000, "dDurationMs": 3519, "segs": [{"utf8": "团队的人。 詹姆森,非常感谢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 783519, "dDurationMs": 3201, "segs": [{"utf8": "他们真的很棒 交易已经", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 786720, "dDurationMs": 2320, "segs": [{"utf8": "厉害 我们正在建立每一个记录。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 789040, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以从菲律宾这里到整个国家", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 791760, "dDurationMs": 3782, "segs": [{"utf8": "东南亚和整个印度-太平洋,这是一个", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 795542, "dDurationMs": 2857, "segs": [{"utf8": "全球最有活力和最有生产力的地区", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 798399, "dDurationMs": 3281, "segs": [{"utf8": "有着巨大的潜力和伟大的朋友", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 801680, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "美国。 你们是好朋友 我的意思是,这是", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 804160, "dDurationMs": 3679, "segs": [{"utf8": "当你认识人的时候 好多了", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 807839, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "我知道几乎所有的人 在桌子上,它只是工作", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 811519, "dDurationMs": 2241, "segs": [{"utf8": "更简单 更好", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 813760, "dDurationMs": 3840, "segs": [{"utf8": "以相克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克克.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 817600, "dDurationMs": 2560, "segs": [{"utf8": "但你知道你想和谁做生意", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 820160, "dDurationMs": 2000, "segs": [{"utf8": "并且它是如此容易 和它去这么快。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 822160, "dDurationMs": 2960, "segs": [{"utf8": "故能现前所行.", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 825120, "dDurationMs": 1519, "segs": [{"utf8": "为什么你们地区这么好?", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 826639, "dDurationMs": 3681, "segs": [{"utf8": "我期待今晚能和大家一起发言", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 830320, "dDurationMs": 3040, "segs": [{"utf8": "进一步加强这些债券,并努力建设", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 833360, "dDurationMs": 3120, "segs": [{"utf8": "对我们人民和你们人民来说,", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 836480, "dDurationMs": 2640, "segs": [{"utf8": "实际上,整个世界。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 839120, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "马科斯总统,我非常感谢你。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 841920, "dDurationMs": 1520, "segs": [{"utf8": "你的家庭是惊人的。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 843440, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "你真厉害 我刚刚遇见了你儿子,他是一个美丽的人", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 846800, "dDurationMs": 3680, "segs": [{"utf8": "年轻人。 他有一个伟大的未来,这是一个荣誉", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 850480, "dDurationMs": 1919, "segs": [{"utf8": "认识你,特别是见到你。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 852399, "dDurationMs": 1680, "segs": [{"utf8": "好吗? 你干得不错", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 854079, "dDurationMs": 1681, "segs": [{"utf8": "你父母干得不错", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 855760, "dDurationMs": 2800, "segs": [{"utf8": "所以,这是伟大的荣誉,非常感谢大家。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 858560, "dDurationMs": 2160, "segs": [{"utf8": "这是一个非常特别的团体。", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 860720, "dDurationMs": 1924, "segs": [{"utf8": "谢谢", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}, {"tStartMs": 862644, "dDurationMs": 2020, "segs": [{"utf8": "[掌声]", "tOffsetMs": 0}]}], "wireMagic": "mb1", "lang": "zh-Hans"}